    "sub_name": "財務報表分析研討",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON FINANCIAL STATEMENT ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在使學生學習如何有效運用財務報表分析之觀念與分析技術以評估企業之獲利能力、風險、清償能力部位、投資報酬及其生產力。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose fo the course is that students learn the concepts and analytical tools of financial statement analysis most effectively by performing to evaluates an enterprise's profitability, risk, liquidity position, return on investment and productivity.",
